</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     SECTION 2 — THE HIDDEN RISKS OF TRADITIONAL COLLABORATION
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="pf-section pf-section--light" aria-labelledby="mp-risk-heading">
  <div class="pf-section__inner">
    <p class="pf-eyebrow pf-eyebrow--center">The Challenge</p>
    <h2 id="mp-risk-heading" class="pf-title pf-title--center">The Hidden Risks of Traditional Member Collaboration</h2>
    <p class="pf-lede pf-lede--center pf-lede--soft">
      The tools most credit unions rely on to move member documents were never built for secure,
      auditable collaboration.
    </p>
    <div class="mp-grid-3">
      <article class="ld-chal__card mp-risk-card">
        <div class="mp-risk-card__head">
          <span class="mp-badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
              <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2" />
              <path d="m22 7-10 5L2 7" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <p class="ld-chal__num">RISK 01</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Email Attachments</h3>
        <p>Sensitive information often includes:</p>
        <ul class="ld-list">
          <li>Driver's licenses</li>
          <li>Income verification</li>
          <li>Tax returns</li>
          <li>Financial statements</li>
          <li>Loan documentation</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="ld-chal__note">Email creates challenges for security, visibility, auditability and compliance.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="ld-chal__card mp-risk-card">
        <div class="mp-risk-card__head">
          <span class="mp-badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
              <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3" />
              <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3" />
              <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3" />
              <path d="m8.6 13.5 6.8 4M15.4 6.5l-6.8 4" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <p class="ld-chal__num">RISK 02</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Public File-Sharing Services</h3>
        <p>Consumer-oriented platforms often result in:</p>
        <ul class="ld-list">
          <li>Loss of control</li>
          <li>Data duplication</li>
          <li>Compliance concerns</li>
          <li>Unmanaged sharing</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="ld-chal__note">Member data leaves your systems — and your governance.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="ld-chal__card mp-risk-card">
        <div class="mp-risk-card__head">
          <span class="mp-badge" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
              <polyline points="12 7 12 12 15 14" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <p class="ld-chal__num">RISK 03</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Manual Processes</h3>
        <p>Manual document collection often leads to:</p>
        <ul class="ld-list">
          <li>Delays</li>
          <li>Missing documents</li>
          <li>Increased operational costs</li>
          <li>Poor member experiences</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="ld-chal__note">Friction slows service and frustrates members.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

